WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.057 --> 00:00:04.685
Everyone waited to hear Badger's secret.

2
00:00:04.686 --> 00:00:08.891
"There is a tunnel," said Badger.

3
00:00:08.892 --> 00:00:14.414
"It leads from the riverbank to Toad Hall."

4
00:00:14.415 --> 00:00:18.463
"That's not true!" said Toad.

5
00:00:18.464 --> 00:00:21.151
"I know Toad Hall!

6
00:00:21.152 --> 00:00:23.708
There's no tunnel."

7
00:00:23.709 --> 00:00:28.001
Badger looked very serious.

8
00:00:28.002 --> 00:00:34.896
"Toad," said Badger, "I knew your father well.

9
00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:39.019
Your father found the tunnel long ago.

10
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.508
He told me not to tell you.

11
00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:47.304
He knew you could not keep a secret."

12
00:00:47.305 --> 00:00:51.428
"That's true," said Toad, turning red.

13
00:00:51.429 --> 00:00:55.906
Then Badger told them some news.

14
00:00:55.907 --> 00:01:00.485
"Yesterday Otter went to Toad Hall.

15
00:01:00.486 --> 00:01:05.928
He pretended to be a house cleaner," said Badger.

16
00:01:05.929 --> 00:01:09.738
"I'll bet the ferrets laughed at him," said Rat.

17
00:01:09.739 --> 00:01:13.286
"They did," said Badger.

18
00:01:13.287 --> 00:01:18.088
"But they also told him about a party."

19
00:01:18.089 --> 00:01:20.793
"What?" said Mole.

20
00:01:20.794 --> 00:01:23.816
"It's true," said Badger.

21
00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:29.151
"Tomorrow is the Chief Weasel's birthday."

22
00:01:29.152 --> 00:01:34.160
"The weasels will be in the dining hall!" cried Toad.

23
00:01:34.161 --> 00:01:38.926
"They will all be eating and drinking."

24
00:01:38.927 --> 00:01:43.881
"And they won't have guns or clubs," said Badger.

25
00:01:43.882 --> 00:01:48.280
"But the ferrets will be on guard!" said Rat.

26
00:01:48.281 --> 00:01:52.762
"The ferrets will never see us," said Badger.

27
00:01:52.763 --> 00:01:57.964
"The tunnel leads right into the broom closet."

28
00:01:57.965 --> 00:02:02.310
"We'll creep out," said Mole.

29
00:02:02.311 --> 00:02:06.657
"With our swords and guns," said Rat.

30
00:02:06.658 --> 00:02:12.882
"And smash them!" cried Toad.

